# oracle: fix deform/pressure tilt pressure control on a triclinic LJ liquid: xy pressure -1.0 1.0 and xz pressure 0.5 1.0 with flip yes (the xy tilt grows past half the box length and flips), fix nve, remap x
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# Measured with native LAMMPS: engine vs native thermo 4.4e-10, atoms 1.4e-10 (the liquid relaxes the shear stress, so the xy tilt keeps growing and flips).
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box prism 0 3 0 3 0 3 0.3 0.2 0.1
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
velocity        all create 1.44 87287 loop geom
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0
timestep        0.005
fix             1 all nve
fix             2 all deform/pressure 1 xy pressure -1.0 1.0 xz pressure 0.5 1.0 flip yes
thermo_style    custom step temp press pxy pxz pyz lx ly lz xy xz yz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
run             300
